I recently found 5 or so potions of speed in a potion shop.
When you drink one, you speed up for a random time.  Most of
you experienced hackers have gotten the message that your legs
get new energy when you drink a second potion of speed.

I recall hearing that the "Your legs get new energy" message
corresponds to increased carrying capacity.  Since I had only
9 Strength, I thought that I might be able drink all 5 potions
and REALLY increase my carrying capacity.

But before I did that, I decided to check the code to see whether
the increased carrying capacity was:
a) cumulative if you drink several potions
b) permanent or temporary

Want to guess what I found?

<SPOILERS>





























In fact, all it seems to do is print the message that "Your legs get
new energy".  Your carrying capacity is not increased at all.  It 
does increase the amount of time you're speeded up for, but that's all.
The only time it increases your carrying capacity is when your legs 
are wounded.

